{
  "Lines": [
    {
      "Start": "00:00:00",
      "End": "00:00:04",
      "Text": "I lent her two keys; she did not lend them to me.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:04",
      "End": "00:00:08",
      "Text": "If dawn stays dark, leave the bell untouched.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:08",
      "End": "00:00:12",
      "Text": "The tide borrowed my shadow, not my voice.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:12",
      "End": "00:00:16",
      "Text": "我只归还了三封信，没有拿走第四封。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:16",
      "End": "00:00:20",
      "Text": "别把灯递给我，给她；我会在门外等。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:20",
      "End": "00:00:24",
      "Text": "月光落进空杯，却没有替我说一句话。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:24",
      "End": "00:00:28",
      "Text": "君が帰らなくても、私は窓を閉めない。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:28",
      "End": "00:00:32",
      "Text": "四つの石のうち、二つだけを川に戻して。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:32",
      "End": "00:00:36",
      "Text": "朝は名前を呼ばずに、橋だけを照らした。",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:36",
      "End": "00:00:40",
      "Text": "그녀가 나를 기다린 게 아니라 내가 그녀를 기다렸어.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:40",
      "End": "00:00:44",
      "Text": "파란 리본은 여기에 두고 검은 우산만 가져가.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    },
    {
      "Start": "00:00:44",
      "End": "00:00:48",
      "Text": "바람은 내 편지를 읽지 않고 창문만 흔들었어.",
      "Secondary": null,
      "Words": [],
      "TranslationOrigin": 0,
      "TranslationLanguage": null
    }
  ],
  "Provider": 5,
  "Match": null
}